flowchart LR
	OUT["model output born in the stream"]
	EM["the em dashes seen first"]
	UI["the live UI"]
	LOG["the durable transcript"]
	HOOK["a file hook rewrites after the fact<br/>perl -CSD -pe over whatever was already written"]
	ASCII["the unicode dash family to ASCII hyphen-minus<br/>in files"]
	OUT --> EM
	EM --> UI
	EM --> LOG
	OUT -. "later" .-> HOOK
	HOOK --> ASCII
